 the trends in the 5,727 Supreme Court and 10,072\nCourt of Appeals cases over the years, as they were available from\nJustia [ 5], which also includes the expansions and creations of the\ncourts themselves.\n4.2 Decomposition\nThe four component data types were decomposed hierarchically\nwith NMFk", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 839, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "438e6159-6d7b-438c-b5af-a6616b5edcaf", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "5", "file_name": "2502.20364.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\raw\\2502.20364.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 6884424, "creation_date": "2025-03-04", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-03"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\raw\\2502.20364.pdf_part_4", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "5", "file_name": "2502.20364.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\raw\\2502.20364.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 6884424, "creation_date": "2025-03-04", "last_modified_date": "2025-03-03"}, "hash": "c30409cf6e818ac161638538cb23eb183e13ec5f04d9ec409b30759a4d7237ee", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "c3c92df9-9dad-453d-95bf-463ec27b917a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"page_label": "5", "file_name": "2502.20364.pdf", "file_path": "C:\\Users\\anteb\\PycharmProjects\\JupyterProject\\naive_rag\\data\\raw\\2502.20364.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size"